  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "國際行銷時文導讀",
    "sub_ename": "INTERNATIONAL MARKETING CURRENT AFFAIRS INTRODUCTION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將接觸各種行銷英文資訊，透過閱讀行銷書籍及文章，教師引導同學認識並討論各項行銷議題，培養學生觀察及分析問題能力，並培養學生在職場所需之口語及書寫溝通技巧。",
    "describe_eh": "Through reading marketing books and articles, the instructor will guide students to understand and discuss various marketing issues, develop students' observation and analytical skills, and develop students' oral and written communication skills required in the workplace.",
